WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.941
Violet laughed. "Good-bye, Rocket Girl!

2
00:00:06.942 --> 00:00:09.299
I'm going to the concert at the park.

3
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.858
It will be my biggest performance yet."

4
00:00:14.859 --> 00:00:18.074
Roxy stood there, holding the steel beam.

5
00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:22.639
She felt as if she was in a dream.

6
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:28.123
"Rocket Girl!" a woman cried. "Wake up!"

7
00:00:28.124 --> 00:00:31.283
But Roxy couldn't move or think clearly.

8
00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:33.453
Her arms felt weak.

9
00:00:33.454 --> 00:00:37.443
The beam fell from her hands and slammed onto the ground.

10
00:00:37.444 --> 00:00:42.056
Bang! Roxy blinked and woke up.

11
00:00:42.057 --> 00:00:45.431
"W-what's going on?" she asked.

12
00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:49.035
"You were hypnotized," the woman said.

13
00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:51.474
"There was a violinist, and she—"

14
00:00:51.475 --> 00:00:59.337
"I remember now!" Roxy also remembered what Violet had said about the concert at the park.

15
00:00:59.338 --> 00:01:01.681
She flew into a store.

16
00:01:01.682 --> 00:01:07.117
A minute later she shot toward Metro City Park.

17
00:01:07.118 --> 00:01:11.131
Violet stood onstage, running her bow across the violin's strings.

18
00:01:11.132 --> 00:01:13.676
Members of the orchestra sat still.

19
00:01:13.677 --> 00:01:16.204
They were all staring into space.

20
00:01:16.228 --> 00:01:18.887
Audience members walked toward the stage.

21
00:01:18.888 --> 00:01:22.829
They held out their wallets and jewelry.

22
00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:28.907
Violet laughed. "I'm going to be rich, rich, rich!"

23
00:01:28.908 --> 00:01:31.746
Roxy watched from far away.

24
00:01:31.747 --> 00:01:34.907
"I'm glad I bought these earplugs."

25
00:01:34.908 --> 00:01:37.600
She popped them into her ears.

26
00:01:37.601 --> 00:01:43.421
"Your big performance is over, Violet!" Roxy darted toward the stage.

27
00:01:43.422 --> 00:01:46.295
"Rocket Girl!" Violet snapped.

28
00:01:46.296 --> 00:01:50.963
She started to play a new song on her violin. "Play

29
