all you want," Roxy said. "I'm wearing earplugs!" Roxy

30
00:01:57.685 --> 00:02:02.178
fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo! Violet

31
00:02:02.194 --> 00:02:04.205
leaped out of the way. The

32
00:02:04.206 --> 00:02:08.049
laser beams hit a French horn, which melted into a puddle. "Yikes!"

33
00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:10.618
Roxy cried. "How

34
00:02:10.619 --> 00:02:12.565
can I stop Violet? I

35
00:02:12.566 --> 00:02:15.070
can't use my eye laser beams again. Someone

36
00:02:15.071 --> 00:02:17.474
might get hurt." Roxy

37
00:02:17.475 --> 00:02:20.479
remembered what Mara had said: "Temperature

38
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.973
affects musical instruments." Roxy

39
00:02:23.974 --> 00:02:30.077
blew her freeze breath at Violet. Whoosh! "Ugh!"

40
00:02:30.078 --> 00:02:32.833
Violet made a face. "My

41
00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:38.270
violin is going out of tune!" Roxy

42
00:02:38.271 --> 00:02:41.764
zoomed over and grabbed the violin. "Your

43
00:02:41.765 --> 00:02:46.323
performance has been canceled, Violet!" Audience

44
00:02:46.324 --> 00:02:48.210
members woke up. They

45
00:02:48.211 --> 00:02:51.950
looked around in surprise. "What's

46
00:02:51.951 --> 00:02:54.908
going on?" a man shouted. "Why

47
00:02:54.909 --> 00:02:57.968
am I on the stage?" "Look!"

48
00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:00.283
Terrell cried. "Rocket

49
00:03:00.284 --> 00:03:07.153
Girl is onstage! Is she playing the violin?" Roxy

50
00:03:07.154 --> 00:03:14.332
grabbed Violet's wrist and flew her to Police Headquarters. ***

51
00:03:14.333 --> 00:03:16.543
"Roxy!" said Mara.

52
00:03:16.544 --> 00:03:19.895
