53
00:03:19.896 --> 00:03:22.896
Roxy sat down next to her friends.

54
00:03:22.897 --> 00:03:26.899
Up onstage, the orchestra played.

55
00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.214
Terrell leaned toward Roxy.

56
00:03:29.215 --> 00:03:32.846
